\newlabel{tab:nomarker}{{3}{5}{Format marker removal results. Pass R = pass recall, Fail R = fail recall. Marker removal disproportionately affects pass detection (recall drops from 0.998 to 0.859) while fail detection remains high (0.990)}{table.caption.6}{}}
